    16	## 0. What V1 encodes, and the encoding map (O-79)
    17	
    18	V1 signs, hashes or publishes six byte strings. Nothing else in the bundle is signed or anchored directly.
    19	
    20	| # | Byte string | Constructed as | Signed / hashed by | Section |
    21	|---|---|---|---|---|
    22	| 1 | Attestation frame, slot `kms` | frame, tag `tessera-v1/attest` | KMS key (OpenPGP); hashed into the anchor preimage | §3 |
