    25	| 4 | Receipt-anchor preimage | tagged, tag `tessera-v1/receipt-anchor` | SHA-256, stamped by OpenTimestamps | §5 |
    26	| 5 | DNSSEC-snapshot preimage | tagged, tag `tessera-v1/dnssec-snapshot` | SHA-256, stamped by OpenTimestamps (C4 snapshot rule) | §6 |
