    32	**Where each of the seven symbolic bindings lives** (A5 §A5.4; A7 §A7.9; R-3.12a):
    33	
    34	| Binding (`framed(...)` argument) | Lives in | Equal across slots? |
    35	|---|---|---|
    36	| object type `objType` | the envelope's `type_tag` = `tessera-v1/attest` | yes (one tag for both slots) |
