docs/implementation-spec.md:1196:| Authority evidence 2: anchored repository publication with commit object, signature, proof material and OTS proof | V20, V23 | A1 §A1.5, a1:434-438 |
docs/implementation-spec.md:1197:| Manifest self-signature (possession only, never an authority channel) | V24 | A1 §A1.5, a1:439-442 |
