   209	**Lemma 7 (anchor preimage).** `A(·,·)` is injective on ordered pairs from `Frm(attest)`, and
   210	`decode_anchor(A(F0, F1)) = (F0, F1)`. Every byte string that `decode_anchor` accepts equals `A` of its decoded
