   214	*Proof.* The header comes first (Lemma 4). Then come the fixed count byte `02`, the length `u32 L0`, exactly `L0`
   215	bytes, the length `u32 L1`, exactly `L1` bytes, and then the end of input. Each boundary is fixed by bytes already
