   215	bytes, the length `u32 L1`, exactly `L1` bytes, and then the end of input. Each boundary is fixed by bytes already
   216	read, as in Lemma 5. Each slot is decoded as a whole frame by Lemma 5. Injectivity follows because the decoder is
   217	a left inverse. ∎
