   223	`F`, the hashed input is `F ‖ T`, where `T = 04 00 pa ha ‖ u16 h ‖ sub ‖ 04 FF ‖ u32(6 + h)` (E§3.5). If the same
   224	signature packet verifies for `F'`, and SHA-256 has no collision on these inputs, then `F' = F`.
